  "post_content": "<p>El Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves su segundo &#39;networking&#39;, organizado por el Club Networking Castell&oacute;n, en el que representantes de una docena de empresas se han podido poner en contacto y establecer sinergias.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/05/IMG_9516.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Ha introducido el el presidente del Club Networking de Castell&oacute;n, Juan Adsuara. Tras un peque&ntilde;o descanso, ha sido el turno de las entrevistas e intercambio directo de una empresa con otra y as&iacute; sucesivamente, para explicarse sus experiencias y poder establecer lazos de colaboraci&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9509.jpg\" alt=\"img_9509\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9510.jpg\" alt=\"img_9510\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9511.jpg\" alt=\"img_9511\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9512.jpg\" alt=\"img_9512\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9513.jpg\" alt=\"img_9513\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9514.jpg\" alt=\"img_9514\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9515.jpg\" alt=\"img_9515\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9516.jpg\" alt=\"img_9516\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9517.jpg\" alt=\"img_9517\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9518.jpg\" alt=\"img_9518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9519.jpg\" alt=\"img_9519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9520.jpg\" alt=\"img_9520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/networkingonda230513/img_9521.jpg\" alt=\"img_9521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
